{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54904","headline":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羣鸟队，飞去又飞来。\n不问（辛本、川本作「以」）下（京本作「在」）营幷在路，此行千里足（京本作「十里走」）难回，仔细察天灾（京本作「威」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}